[Step 4] DNS Name Resolution via Local DNS Server (192.168.100.4):

PC1> nslookup cse.myuniv.edu
Server:  dns.cse.myuniv.edu
Address: 192.168.100.4

Non-authoritative answer:
Name:    cse.myuniv.edu
Address: 192.168.100.10

PC1> nslookup ftp.cse.myuniv.edu
Server:  dns.ftp.cse.myuniv.edu
Address: 192.168.100.4

Non-authoritative answer:
Name:    ftp.cse.myuniv.edu
Address: 192.168.100.20

[Step 5] Accessing Departmental Web Server via Domain Name:

PC1> curl http://cse.myuniv.edu/

PC1> nslookup cse.myuniv.edu
Server:  dns.cse.myuniv.edu
Address: 192.168.100.4

