[Observation & Summary]:
  - Full enterprise multi-service LAN implemented and validated successfully.
  - Client dynamic lifecycle: Boot (DHCP) -> Domain Lookup (DNS) -> Web Browsing (HTTP) -> File Download (FTP).
  - High-level services cooperate seamlessly over IEEE 802.3 Layer 2 microsegmentation.
